using Global

~ ending_start

Noman: No severance. No goodwill. Just — go.

Noman: And Jason. We'll be watching. Not because we think you're brave enough to talk.

Noman: Because we don't leave that to chance.

if Global.reckoning_choice == "walked":
	Noman: You didn't even try to take anything with you on the way out. Smartest thing you did the whole time you worked here.
elif Global.priya_path == "escalated" and Global.escalation_backfired:
	Noman: That business with the finance director, incidentally. It's part of why this is going the way it's going.

Jason: (He left with nothing. Not even the illusion that he'd earned his way out of it.)

# --- ENDING: THREATENED ---
# Low Compliance, low Leverage, but not catastrophic. Jason leaves
# silenced by fear, empty-handed, still under watch.

=> END
